<title>JAPAN: Nippon Shokubai -96/97 parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Nippon Shokubai -96/97 parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 44.00	     135.01</p>
<p> Current		2.70		 9.17</p>
<p> Net		    1.40		 5.32</p>
<p> EPS		    7.11 yen	  27.02 yen</p>
<p> Ord div		2.35 yen	   7.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Shokubai Co Ltd is a leading chemical</p>
<p>maker. The latest forecasts were for the four-month period</p>
<p>ending March 31, 1997, because the company changed its</p>
<p>business term. The year-ago figures were for the full</p>
<p>year to November 30, 1996.</p>
</text>
